full-query: "You need to maintain an AWS Organization. The Organization includes several organization units (OUs) and dozens of accounts. You want to get the service last access data for different OUs and accounts. Then you can refine the policies in the Organization and allow access to only the services that the entities in the AWS Organization use. Which method would you take to address this requirement?"
